{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786925141493562148,"compiled_state":{"alias":"fleeting-choosey-dore","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"9eaf07f528438d0cf77250db5a35e0b6872d020ad1ca1e07fb56ecc44d46dc38","event_uuid":"8d85026b-c957-4de3-935a-fe023efb5c37","position":{"commit_sha":"48e285c21fe00fd8572c091bc597eb0c407f9548","position":"1786922832417096001-8d85026b-c957-4de3-935a-fe023efb5c37"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"9f3f39a077801ab775a5631b671f16d9ac60f81f7aa08908db7e996bef1cb8c9","event_uuid":"7011cb8c-8b8d-45a8-be37-7910b864b467","position":{"commit_sha":"1489240a2267ace03b27874c344ce3a82a6f3d6f","position":"1786922839928514001-7011cb8c-8b8d-45a8-be37-7910b864b467"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786922832417096001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"7011cb8c-8b8d-45a8-be37-7910b864b467","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e06a-1450-5e1b-42fc"}],"description":"## Context\n`make lint` deterministically prints: `WARN audit: zizmor is running in offline mode by default; some audits and auto-fixes will not be available.` The gate still exits successfully, so contributors can report a clean lint run while the tool says part of its audit surface is unavailable. A tracker search for `zizmor offline mode` found no open bug owning the warning. Discovered while verifying `treelike-unamusing-grosbeak`.\n\n## Reproduction\nFrom a provisioned checkout, run `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint` and inspect the zizmor step.\n\n## Plan\nUse `rebar-debug` to identify exactly which audits are disabled offline, whether Gerrit CI has network/capabilities to run them, and whether the current invocation is deliberate. If changing online/offline policy affects portability, network access, or CI behavior, return an evidence-backed decision brief rather than silently choosing.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Root cause and the exact unavailable audit capabilities are proven against the pinned zizmor version.\n- [ ] Local/no-network and Gerrit CI behavior are both evaluated.\n- [ ] The warning is eliminated by a reviewed policy or explicitly documented/suppressed only if the warning is proven intentional and coverage-equivalent safeguards are cited.\n- [ ] `make lint` and relevant workflow gates remain green.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["warning","ci","security","zizmor"],"ticket_id":"7a03-74f2-e812-4104","ticket_type":"bug","title":"make lint runs zizmor offline and leaves online audits unavailable","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8d85026b-c957-4de3-935a-fe023efb5c37","7011cb8c-8b8d-45a8-be37-7910b864b467"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786925141493562148,"uuid":"39a3afba-5768-465b-b5aa-19c8d76d835f"}